ht empty raid is Do-or-Die. CPU: skill s, Easy/Medium/Hard brain. PROOF = validate's simulated players on the real engine over 40/100 match seeds.","intent":"Spike built only from chapter 2's verbs: level at 13-13, 4 raids each left. You are on 1 empty raid (one more patient raid is allowed, a second would make the third Do-or-Die), their raider takes one touch or hops the bonus. Ankle-catchers on the corners make your bonus hop a real risk (READ); the rookies in slots 2 and 6 are the safe touches, the T's beside the Blocker want the Toe. Aha: in a one-point game, count the empties — bank one safe Toe point early, then decide whether the bonus is worth its risk. Win by 1.","mechanics":["empty-raid counter","bonus line","toe touch","dubki","block (defensive wall)","ankle-catchers"],"optimal":null,"branching":18,"trap":null,"explored":40000},{"n":21,"grid":"[Ghost Duel · breather · Ch2 District Cup] OPP MAT: o T o o o T o · grip 0.45 · KEY: o rookie, T thigh-holder (Hand/walk risky)\nMY SIDE: o o o o o o o (7 on mat)\nFLOW: you raid 4x\nMY MOVES: hand toe bonus walk dash dubki pull\nREAD (gem % held) touch: 1o:h15/t5 2T:h25/t7 3o:h16/t6 4o:h7/t6 5o:h16/t6 6T:h25/t7 7o:h15/t5 bonus:5 | home after 1 touch: walk 25%, dash 12%, dubki 9% | after 2: walk 32%, dash 16%, dubki 13% | if held: pull 44%\nGOAL: beat the ghost's 4 points, 1x bonus | FAIL: raider out 2x | STARS: Earn 2 bonus points; Never get caught\nPROOF (validate, real engine, fresh match seeds): a competent player won 37/40 (best 3★), a mid-skill player 81/100","legend":"KABADDI RAID TRIAL (content unit; the player raids and defends in turns). OPP MAT = 7 defender slots, left corner → right corner ('-' = out). Defender traits: o rookie; T Thigh-holder (beats Hand Touch + walking home); A Ankle-catcher (beats Toe Touch, bonus hop, Dubki); B Blocker (midline wall, beats the Dash home); R Rusher (charges: beats hops and touches; a Backward Kick tags him); C Chain link (two adjacent C's chain: beat walk/dash home, 