op and Block the Dash. 4 raids each, win by 2.","mechanics":["defence reads repeats","backward kick","rusher defenders","blocker wall","dubki","defender rush","block (defensive wall)","bonus line"],"optimal":null,"branching":22,"trap":null,"explored":40000},{"n":31,"grid":"[Revival Run · spike · Ch3 State League] OPP MAT: o T R o B T o · grip 0.95 · KEY: o rookie, T thigh-holder (Hand/walk risky), R rusher (touch/hop risky, Kick safe), B blocker (Dash risky) · SCOUTED: a move from your last raid is tagged on its gem and ~6 pts more likely held (capped, same on every mat)\nMY SIDE: - - o - o - o (3 on mat)\nFLOW: alternate raids 15:00→20:00 (~7 raids in all, ~4 each) · start score 5-9\nMY MOVES: hand toe kick bonus walk dash dubki pull lunge | DEFENCE: ankle thigh block rush hold\nCPU RAIDER \"State raider\": s 0.68 · Easy · touches hand/toe · home walk/dash · up to 1 touch\nREAD (gem % held) touch: 1o:h29/t10 2T:h51/t22 3R:h45/t30/k12 4o:h25/t23 5B:h34/t15 6T:h46/t15 7o:h29/t10 bonus:31 | home after 1 touch: walk 53%, dash 48%, dubki 24% | after 2: walk 64%, dash 58%, dubki 31% | if held: pull 38%, lunge 38%\nREAD (gem % stop, made by the cover): vs his touch — hand: ankle 17/thigh 45/rush 26; toe: ankle 46/thigh 16/rush 28 | vs his way home — walk: ankle 17/thigh 29/block 22/rush 13; dash: ankle 27/thigh 14/block 42/rush 9 | his touch lands 87% if untackled\nGOAL: finish within 2 | FAIL: trail by > 8 | STARS: Draw level; Land a Super Tackle\nPROOF (validate, real engine, fresh match seeds): a competent player won 34/40 (best 3★), a mid-skill player 72/100","legend":"KABADDI RAID TRIAL (content unit; the player raids and defends in turns). OPP MAT = 7 defender slots, left corner → right corner ('-' = out). Defender traits: o rookie; T Thigh-holder (beats Hand Touch + walking home); A Ankle-catcher (beats Toe Touch, bonus hop, Dubki); B Blocker (midline wall, beats the Dash home); R Rusher (charges: beats hops and touches; a Backward Kick tags him); C Chain link (two