ick bonus walk dash dubki pull lunge | DEFENCE: ankle thigh block rush hold\nCPU RAIDER \"State champion\": s 0.69 · Medium · touches hand/toe/bonus/kick · home walk/dash/dubki · up to 2 touches\nREAD (gem % held) touch: 1R:h49/t32/k11 2T:h58/t27 3B:h39/t18 4o:h20/t18 5B:h39/t18 6T:h58/t27 7R:h49/t32/k11 bonus:71 | home after 1 touch: walk 66%, dash 71%, dubki 34% | after 2: walk 77%, dash 81%, dubki 43% | if held: pull 36%, lunge 35%\nREAD (gem % stop, made by the cover): vs his touch — hand: ankle 17/thigh 44/rush 26; toe: ankle 45/thigh 16/rush 28; bonus: ankle 28/thigh 18/rush 48; kick: ankle 15/thigh 18/rush 4 | vs his way home — walk: ankle 17/thigh 29/block 22/rush 12; dash: ankle 26/thigh 14/block 41/rush 9; dubki: ankle 30/thigh 5/block 7/rush 12 | his touch lands 87% if untackled | Hold (step back) vs a real Kick: it finds nobody 65% of the time\nGOAL: win by 1+ | STARS: Win by 3; Win by 6\nPROOF (validate, real engine, fresh match seeds): a competent player won 34/40 (best 3★), a mid-skill player 69/100","legend":"KABADDI RAID TRIAL (content unit; the player raids and defends in turns). OPP MAT = 7 defender slots, left corner → right corner ('-' = out). Defender traits: o rookie; T Thigh-holder (beats Hand Touch + walking home); A Ankle-catcher (beats Toe Touch, bonus hop, Dubki); B Blocker (midline wall, beats the Dash home); R Rusher (charges: beats hops and touches; a Backward Kick tags him); C Chain link (two adjacent C's chain: beat walk/dash home, Dubki ducks under); K rival captain (strong at everything except his one listed weakness). Danger comes from the target and his neighbours and grows with every touch already made. SCOUTED: only on trials whose OPP MAT row says SCOUTED, a move used on my previous raid is read — its gem shows a SCOUTED tag and the higher % (capped at ~8 points); rows that say 'no scouting' never show the tag. READ rows = the % the game shows on each option gem, never a recommendation (h/t/k = Hand/Toe/Kick touch on that slot