fe), B blocker (Dash risky) · SCOUTED: a move from your last raid is tagged on its gem and ~6 pts more likely held (capped, same on every mat)\nMY SIDE: o o o o o o o (7 on mat) · raider reach 7 agi 6 spd 6\nFLOW: alternate raids 00:00→10:00 (~14 raids in all, ~7 each, half-time swap at 05:00)\nMY MOVES: hand toe kick bonus walk dash dubki pull lunge | DEFENCE: ankle thigh block rush hold\nCPU RAIDER \"Franchise captain\": s 0.69 · Medium · touches hand/toe/bonus · home walk/dash/dubki · up to 2 touches · feints 15%\nAUCTION (purse 75): Raider R8 open 25 market 30-55; Corner(ankle corner) open 12 market 14-28; Anchor(anchor) open 18 market 20-36; Cover(cover) open 10 market 12-22; Corner(thigh corner) open 10 market 12-24; Anchor(anchor) open 15 market 16-30; Cover(cover) open 8 market 8-18\nREAD (gem % held) touch: 1A:h35/t52 2T:h60/t46 3R:h55/t38/k17 4B:h42/t39 5R:h55/t38/k17 6T:h60/t46 7A:h35/t52 bonus:81 | home after 1 touch: walk 70%, dash 59%, dubki 69% | after 2: walk 80%, dash 70%, dubki 79% | if held: pull 39%, lunge 36%\nREAD (gem % stop, made by the cover): vs his touch — hand: ankle 17/thigh 44/rush 26; toe: ankle 45/thigh 16/rush 27; bonus: ankle 27/thigh 18/rush 48 | vs his way home — walk: ankle 16/thigh 29/block 21/rush 12; dash: ankle 26/thigh 14/block 41/rush 9; dubki: ankle 30/thigh 5/block 7/rush 12 | his touch lands 87% if untackled\nGOAL: win by 1+ | STARS: Win by 4; Win by 7\nPROOF (validate, real engine, fresh match seeds): a competent player won 36/40 (best 3★), a mid-skill player 71/100","legend":"KABADDI RAID TRIAL (content unit; the player raids and defends in turns). OPP MAT = 7 defender slots, left corner → right corner ('-' = out). Defender traits: o rookie; T Thigh-holder (beats Hand Touch + walking home); A Ankle-catcher (beats Toe Touch, bonus hop, Dubki); B Blocker (midline wall, beats the Dash home); R Rusher (charges: beats hops and touches; a Backward Kick tags him); C Chain link (two adjacent C's chain: beat walk/dash home, Dub